  "locked": false,
  "title": "[SwiftHFR] Réglages › Sécurité: the app-lock switch names the method the device has (#1173)",
  "user": {
   "login": "francoisgn",
   "id": 32835330,
   "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyODM1MzMw",
